      },
      {
        "seconds": 5.5,
        "narration": "郑钦文，在北京捧起首座一千赛冠军奖杯。"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 0,
        "end": 10,
        "narration": "北京时间十月十一日晚上，中网女单决赛。郑钦文对阵安德烈耶娃。",
        "bed": "low"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 10,
        "end": 26.6,
        "narration": "前四轮比赛，全部进入第三盘。决赛零比二落后，她立即回破，追到二比二。",
        "bed": "low"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 132.4,
        "end": 144.7,
        "narration": "四比五，十五比四十。三个盘点，郑钦文全部救回。",
        "bed": "low"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 144.7,
        "end": 149.2,
        "narration": "",
        "bed": "high"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 149.2,
        "end": 156.2,
        "narration": "郑钦文在底线反复改变落点，逼对手从一侧边线追到另一侧。",
        "bed": "low"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 156.2,
        "end": 172.12,
        "narration": "",
        "bed": "high"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 172.12,
        "end": 173.36,
        "narration": "",
        "bed": "high"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 173.36,
        "end": 185.28,
        "narration": "",
        "bed": "high"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 185.28,
        "end": 189.8,
        "narration": "连赢十一分，七比五拿下首盘。",
        "bed": "high"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 189.8,
        "end": 193.0,
        "narration": "",
        "bed": "high"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 193.0,
        "end": 201.3,
        "narration": "",
        "bed": "high"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 201.3,
        "end": 207.8,
        "narration": "",
        "bed": "high"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 207.8,
        "end": 228.2,
        "narration": "第二盘先破发，又被马上回破。侧向追球后，她迅速回到中路，准备下一拍。",
        "bed": "low"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 228.2,
        "end": 233.08,
        "narration": "",
        "bed": "high"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 248.12,
        "end": 263.44,
        "narration": "四比四，先把对手局点救回平分。第四次破发机会，她终于兑现，五比四领先。",
        "bed": "low"
      },
      {
        "seconds": 12.0,
        "narration": "第一发球进球率只有百分之三十八，第二发球却赢下二十三分。胜赛局从零比三十追到赛点。她能把冠军留在北京吗？"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 263.44,
        "end": 276.1,
        "narration": "",
        "bed": "high"
      },
      {
        "source": "main",
        "start": 276.1,
