  "actual_absolute_cues": [
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 270.08,
      "source_end": 273.9,
      "text": "And the ultimate exclamation point\n这就是最后的点睛一击，"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 273.9,
      "source_end": 276.0,
      "text": "to conquer the China Open!\n征服中网！"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 145.04,
      "source_end": 147.57999999999998,
      "text": "Not easy. Made it look rather pedestrian,\n真不容易，她却打得很轻松，"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 147.57999999999998,
      "source_end": 148.95,
      "text": "but that was a tough overhead.\n这记高压其实很难。"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 189.98000000000002,
      "source_end": 192.96,
      "text": "Oh, what a way to cap it off for their first ace.\n首记ACE，精彩收下首盘！"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 193.0,
      "source_end": 194.65,
      "text": "And Zheng Qinwen\n郑钦文"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 194.65,
      "source_end": 196.35,
      "text": "will have them out of their seats in Beijing.\n要让北京球迷起立！"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 196.35,
      "source_end": 197.55,
      "text": "They're starting to realize\n球迷开始意识到，"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 197.55,
      "source_end": 199.3,
      "text": "they're on the precipice of history\n改写历史近在眼前，"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 199.3,
      "source_end": 200.77,
      "text": "at the China Open.\n就在中网赛场上。"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 201.3,
      "source_end": 203.3,
      "text": "The first Chinese player to reach the final\n首位闯入决赛的中国球员，"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 203.3,
      "source_end": 206.25,
      "text": "is one set from lifting the trophy.\n再赢一盘，就能捧起奖杯。"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 206.57000000000002,
      "source_end": 207.70000000000002,
      "text": "Thank you so much.\n非常感谢。"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 228.39999999999998,
      "source_end": 230.11999999999998,
      "text": "Listen for the ecstasy.\n听这狂喜的欢呼！"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 270.08,
      "source_end": 273.9,
      "text": "And the ultimate exclamation point\n这就是最后的点睛一击，"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 273.9,
      "source_end": 276.0,
      "text": "to conquer the China Open!\n征服中网！"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 281.3,
      "source_end": 283.92,
      "text": "Well, her popularity amongst\n她的人气，"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 283.92,
      "source_end": 285.86,
      "text": "1.4 billion people\n在十四亿人之中，"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 285.86,
      "source_end": 288.3,
      "text": "is about to go to another\n即将跃上一个"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 289.98,
      "source_end": 292.64,
      "text": "out-of-this-world stratosphere level.\n难以想象的新高度！"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 292.64,
      "source_end": 294.52,
      "text": "It is going to be unbelievable\n那将是不可思议的一幕，"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 294.52,
      "source_end": 297.7,
      "text": "as they will coronate the queen of the China Open,\n他们将为中网女王加冕——"
    },
    {
      "source": "main",
      "source_at": 298.0,
      "source_end": 299.26,
      "text": "Zheng Qinwen!\n郑钦文！"
    }
  ],
